// Hand-maintained routing overlay — the half of config/sites.js's data that
// Business Manager / SCAPI has no concept of: URL aliases and the
// sfccSiteId override used when multiple PWA sites share one real SFCC site
// (EU domestic's 4-locale split). Locale/currency truth instead comes from
